Package: nparseplus
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: prokopto-dev <noreply@github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/prokopto-dev/nparse-plus
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC_FLOOR@), libgl1, libegl1, libglib2.0-0, libfontconfig1,
 libfreetype6, libdbus-1-3, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libx11-6,
 libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0,
 libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0,
 libxcb-shm0, libxcb-sync1, libxcb-xfixes0, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-xkb1,
 libxext6, libxrender1, libxi6, libsm6, libice6, libnss3, libnspr4,
 libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxrandr2, libxfixes3, libxtst6, libasound2,
 libcups2, libatk1.0-0, libatk-bridge2.0-0, libatspi2.0-0, libdrm2, libgbm1,
 libexpat1, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2, zlib1g
Recommends: espeak-ng, dbus-user-session
Description: EverQuest Project 1999 log-parsing overlay
 nParse+ tails your EverQuest Project 1999 log file and draws maps, spell and
 respawn timers, triggers, a DPS meter and sharing overlays over the game.
 .
 This package contains a self-contained build: it bundles its own Python and
 Qt, so no distribution Python packages are required. It is built on Debian 12
 (bookworm), which is what sets its glibc floor -- the generic Linux tarball on
 the releases page is built on a newer distribution and will not run here.
